.TH SDL_iconv_t 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_iconv_t \- An opaque handle representing string encoding conversion state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_stdinc.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_iconv_data_t *SDL_iconv_t;
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

